# @nimiplatform/nimi Licensing Map

This repository is multi-licensed by component. The defaults below describe
Nimi-authored material; they do not relicense third-party material.

- `runtime/**`, `nimi-cognition/**`, `sdks/typescript/**`, `proto/**`, `app-tools/**`, `npm-packages/**`: Apache-2.0
- `apps/**`, `kit/**`: MIT
- `app-tools/templates/default-starter/**`, `app-tools/templates/app-source/**`: MIT (override the `app-tools/**` default)
- `runtime/internal/engine/assets/locateanything_loader/**`: third-party source with file-specific notices and separate upstream code/model license declarations; see that directory's NOTICE.md and retained license texts (exceptions to the Runtime default for upstream files)
- `apps/avatar/src/shell/renderer/public/assets/js/live2d-cubism-core/**`: Live2D Cubism Core under the Live2D Proprietary Software License; see its Core/LICENSE.md and original file header (exception to the App MIT default)
- `docs/**`, `.nimi/spec/**`: CC-BY-4.0

Canonical texts are in `licenses/`.

Third-party source, linked libraries, downloaded engine binaries and their
dependencies retain their own licenses and attribution requirements. Model
weights have separate terms, including non-commercial terms for some models;
the Runtime or SDK license does not grant rights to those weights. Audit the
actual distribution payload, embedded files and separately acquired components
before describing an artifact's licensing or signing eligibility.
